  "changes": [
    "Admission owner reads inherited policy and checks permission around consumption of a one-use dispatch permit.",
    "Confirmed absent budgets avoid quotation and storage with zero allocations in the owner test.",
    "Token-only budgets preserve unknown monetary cost as null and cannot bypass spend meters.",
    "Required settlement uses a bounded context after cancellation and can retain measured evidence for restart recovery.",
    "Exact evidence retries normalize absent and empty quantity maps.",
    "Setup rollback verifies the exact retained holder marker and refuses unexpected budget state.",
    "Storage and catalog tests use separate namespaces and verify cleanup.",
    "Conflicting retry evidence cannot replace an unresolved overflow record."
  ],
